# No Page-Level CSS

The use of `.module.css` files and the inclusion of Tailwind utility classes directly in `className` props are forbidden within the `app/` and `features/` directories. All styling must be encapsulated within the design system.

## Why
Prevents style fragmentation and ensures that all UI elements remain token-aligned and reusable.

## Examples
// ❌ BAD (in app/page.tsx)
<div className="flex p-4 bg-blue-500">...</div>

// ✅ GOOD
<Card variant="primary" padding="md">...</Card>
